      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a relaxed and very easy tourist experience, stick to Central London areas like Covent Garden, Kensington, and Soho; these are highly polished and very safe. Areas like Brixton or parts of East London (like Stratford) offer distinct local cultures but require more situational awareness, especially late at night. Always prioritize walking in well-lit, busy areas, regardless of the borough, and use reputable transport services for nighttime travel.",
